abstract: >-
  A self-contained written singleton-component classification and exact catalog
  of30240 ten-coordinate five-cycle forms, with full cube and Walsh checks,
  supplements the retained ten conditional degree-five Boolean exclusions.
  The fourteen-variable existence problem remains open. Substantial AI
  assistance and review; no formal verification, human review or novelty claimed.
